#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""The Ashen Crypt: a sample dungeon crawler for the Blobber engine.

Hollowmere, a market town on the edge of the Fenwold.  Beneath its ruined
chapel lies the crypt of Morvane, the Ashen King, and he is waking.  Take a
party of six down through the Undercroft, the Catacombs and the Ashen
Halls, destroy the King, and bring his crown to the temple to be unmade.

Run it with ./ashencrypt (Python 3 with Tk, nothing else).  The game is
saved to ~/.ashencrypt.json.  ./ashencrypt --selftest checks the maps.
"""

